! <solver:p610_t3>
! Taylor vertical-cut cohesive slope (T3, plane strain) - lambda = 1.3
!
! Pre-excavation domain: [0, 8] m x [-4, 0] m, 16 x 8 graded quads -> 256 T3 elements (153 nodes).
! Excavation (layer 1): wedge x in [0, 3] m, y in [-2, 0] m -> 48 T3 elements removed.
! BCs: y=-4 rigid base; x=0 and x=8 roller (ux=0).
!
! Material (design + lambda * gamma): phi=0 deg, c=10 kPa, gamma=26 kN/m^3, E=10000 kPa, nu=0.3.
! Closed-form planar-slip FoS: 0.7692  (= 4*c / (lambda*gamma*H) = 4*10 / (1.3*20*2))
!
! Verification (Option A - gravity lambda-sweep):
!   tools/build_all_slope_smoke_packages.ps1 runs every lambda variant in this
!   folder, classifies each .res as converged (max iters < limit) or not, and
!   reports lambda_collapse_FE = midpoint(max_converged_lambda, min_diverged_lambda).
!   Verdict PASS when |lambda_collapse_FE - expected_FoS|/expected_FoS <= tolerance.
! <BEGIN:AnalysisOptions>
! failure_criterion MohrCoulomb
! material_type Isotropic
! mesh_type T3
! solver_executable p610_t3_mohr_coulomb
! expected_FoS 1
! expected_FoS_tolerance_pct 25
! expected_FoS_mode lambda_sweep
! lambda_factor 1.3
! slope_geometry taylor_phi0_vertical
! slope_angle_deg 90.0
! slope_height_m 2
! <END:AnalysisOptions>
